{"book":"hono","chapter":"helpers","chapterTitle":"المساعدات","slug":"css","title":"مساعد css","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"import","text":"Import"},{"depth":2,"id":"css","text":"css"},{"depth":3,"id":"التوسيع","text":"التوسيع"},{"depth":3,"id":"الأنماط-العامة","text":"الأنماط العامة"},{"depth":2,"id":"keyframes","text":"keyframes"},{"depth":2,"id":"cx","text":"cx"},{"depth":2,"id":"الاستخدام-بالاقتران-مع-الترويسات-الآمنة-الوسيط","text":"الاستخدام بالاقتران مع الترويسات الآمنة الوسيط"},{"depth":2,"id":"createcsscontext","text":"createCssContext"},{"depth":3,"id":"classnameslug","text":"classNameSlug"},{"depth":3,"id":"oninvalidslug","text":"onInvalidSlug"},{"depth":2,"id":"الأمان","text":"الأمان"},{"depth":2,"id":"نصائح","text":"نصائح"}],"html":"<p>مُساعد CSS - <code>hono/css</code> - هو CSS in JS(X) المدمج في Hono.</p>\n<p>يمكنك كتابة CSS في JSX داخل قالب نصي (template literal) في JavaScript يُسمّى <code>css</code>. القيمة المُرجَعة من <code>css</code> سيكون اسم الفئة (class name)، وهو مضبوط على قيمة خاصية class. حيث <code>&lt;Style /&gt;</code> سيحتوي المكوّن بعد ذلك على قيمة CSS.</p>\n<h2 id=\"import\">Import</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { css, cx, keyframes, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Style</span>, createCssContext } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/css&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"css\"><code>css</code> <Badge style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" type=\"warning\" text=\"Experimental\" /></h2>\n<p>يمكنك كتابة CSS في <code>css</code> قالب حرفي (template literal). في هذه الحالة، يستخدم <code>headerClass</code> كقيمة لـ <code>class</code> السمة. لا تنسَ إضافة <code>&lt;Style /&gt;</code> لأنه يحتوي على محتوى CSS.</p>\n<div class=\"callout callout--note\">\n<p><strong>ملاحظة</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> headerClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n    <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: orange;\n    <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: white;\n    <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1rem</span>;\n  `</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Style</span> /&gt;</span><span class=\"language-css\">\n      &lt;/head&gt;</span></span>\n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"language-css\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">body</span>&gt;\n        &lt;<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> class={headerClass}&gt;Hello!&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span>&gt;\n      &lt;/<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>يمكنك تنسيق الفئات الزائفة (pseudo-classes) مثل <code>:hover</code> باستخدام <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Nesting_selector\">مُحدِّد التداخل</a>, <code>&amp;</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> buttonClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#fff</span>;\n  &amp;<span class=\"hljs-selector-pseudo\">:hover</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: red;\n  }\n`</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"التوسيع\">التوسيع</h3>\n<p>يمكنك توسيع تعريف CSS عبر تضمين اسم الصنف (class name).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> baseClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: white;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: blue;\n`</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> header1Class = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  </span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${baseClass}</span><span class=\"language-css\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">3rem</span>;\n`</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> header2Class = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  </span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${baseClass}</span><span class=\"language-css\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">2rem</span>;\n`</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>بالإضافة إلى ذلك، صياغة <code>${baseClass} {}</code> يتيح تعشيش الأصناف.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> headerClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: white;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: blue;\n`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> containerClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  </span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${headerClass}</span><span class=\"language-css\"> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">3rem</span>;\n    }\n  }\n`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">render</span>(\n  <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{containerClass}</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{headerClass}</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Hello!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n)\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"الأنماط-العامة\">الأنماط العامة</h3>\n<p>مُحدِّد زائف يُسمى <code>:-hono-global</code> يسمح لك بتعريف أنماط عامة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> globalClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  :-hono-global {\n    <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">html</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-family</span>: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    }\n  }\n`</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">render</span>(\n  <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{globalClass}</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Hello!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>Today is a good day.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n)\n</code></pre>\n<p>أو يمكنك كتابة CSS في <code>&lt;Style /&gt;</code> مكوّن بـ <code>css</code> حرفي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> renderer = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">jsxRenderer</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ children, title }</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Style</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-css\">{css`\n          <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">html</span> {\n            <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-family</span>: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n          }\n        `}</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Style</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>{title}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span>\n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>{children}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"keyframes\"><code>keyframes</code> <Badge style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" type=\"warning\" text=\"Experimental\" /></h2>\n<p>يمكنك استخدام <code>keyframes</code> لكتابة محتويات <code>@keyframes</code>. في هذه الحالة، <code>fadeInAnimation</code> سيكون اسم الرسم المتحرك (animation).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> fadeInAnimation = keyframes<span class=\"hljs-string\">`\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> headerClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">animation-name</span>: </span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${fadeInAnimation}</span><span class=\"language-css\">;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">animation-duration</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">2s</span>;\n`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Header</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) =&gt; <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{headerClass}</span>&gt;</span>Hello!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>&gt;</span></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"cx\"><code>cx</code> <Badge style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" type=\"warning\" text=\"Experimental\" /></h2>\n<p>الـ <code>cx</code> يدمج اسمي الفئتين (class names).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> buttonClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border-radius</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">10px</span>;\n`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> primaryClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background</span>: orange;\n`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Button</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) =&gt; (\n  <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{cx(buttonClass,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">primaryClass</span>)}&gt;</span>Click!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>&gt;</span></span>\n)\n</code></pre>\n<p>يمكنه أيضًا تركيب سلاسل نصية بسيطة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Header</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) =&gt; <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{cx(</span>&#x27;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">h1</span>&#x27;, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">primaryClass</span>)}&gt;</span>Hi<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>&gt;</span></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الاستخدام-بالاقتران-مع-الترويسات-الآمنة-الوسيط\">الاستخدام بالاقتران مع <a href=\"https://hono.dev/docs/middleware/builtin/secure-headers\">الترويسات الآمنة</a> الوسيط</h2>\n<p>إذا أردت استخدام مساعدات CSS (CSS helpers) مع <a href=\"https://hono.dev/docs/middleware/builtin/secure-headers\">الترويسات الآمنة</a> الوسيط، يمكنك إضافة <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Global_attributes/nonce\"><code>nonce</code> السمة</a> إلى <code>&lt;Style nonce={c.get('secureHeadersNonce')} /&gt;</code> لتجنّب Content-Security-Policy الناتج عن مساعدات CSS.</p>\n<div class=\"callout callout--note\">\n<p><strong>ملاحظة</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { secureHeaders, <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">NONCE</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/secure-headers&#x27;</span>\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">secureHeaders</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">contentSecurityPolicy</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Set the pre-defined nonce value to `styleSrc`:</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">styleSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">NONCE</span>],\n    },\n  })\n)\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> headerClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n    <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: orange;\n    <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: white;\n    <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1rem</span>;\n  `</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n        {/* Set the `nonce` attribute on the CSS helpers `style` and `script` elements */}\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Style</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">nonce</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{c.get(</span>&#x27;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">secureHeadersNonce</span>&#x27;)} /&gt;</span><span class=\"language-css\">\n      &lt;/head&gt;</span></span>\n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"language-css\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">body</span>&gt;\n        &lt;<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> class={headerClass}&gt;Hello!&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span>&gt;\n      &lt;/<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"createcsscontext\"><code>createCssContext</code> <Badge style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" type=\"warning\" text=\"Experimental\" /></h2>\n<p><code>createCssContext</code> يُنشئ دوال مساعدة CSS (<code>css</code>, <code>cx</code>, <code>keyframes</code>, <code>viewTransition</code>, <code>Style</code>) مع سياق مخصص. يمكنك استخدامه لتخصيص معرف عنصر النمط (style) وأسماء الفئات المُنشأة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { createCssContext } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/css&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { css, cx, keyframes, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Style</span> } = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createCssContext</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;my-app&#x27;</span>,\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"classnameslug\"><code>classNameSlug</code></h3>\n<p>افتراضياً، تُولَّد أسماء أصناف CSS (class names) بالصيغة <code>css-1234567890</code>. يمكنك تخصيص هذا بتمرير <code>classNameSlug</code> الدالة.</p>\n<p>تستقبل الدالة ثلاثة وسائط (arguments):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>hash</code> - اسم الفئة (class) المولّد الافتراضي (مثل <code>css-1234567890</code>)</li>\n<li><code>label</code> - مُستخرَج من <code>/* comment */</code> عند بداية قالب CSS (سلسلة فارغة إن لم يوجد)</li>\n<li><code>css</code> - سلسلة CSS المُصغّرة</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { css, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Style</span> } = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createCssContext</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;my-styles&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">classNameSlug</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">hash, label</span>) =&gt;</span> (label ? <span class=\"hljs-string\">`h-<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${label}</span>`</span> : hash),\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> heroClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* hero-section */</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background</span>: blue;\n`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Generated class name: &quot;h-hero-section&quot;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"oninvalidslug\"><code>onInvalidSlug</code></h3>\n<p>إذا كان <code>classNameSlug</code> أرجعت الدالة اسم فئة CSS غير صالح، يتم تسجيل تحذير افتراضيًا. يمكنك تخصيص هذا السلوك باستخدام <code>onInvalidSlug</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { css, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Style</span> } = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createCssContext</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;my-styles&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">classNameSlug</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">hash, label</span>) =&gt;</span> label || hash,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onInvalidSlug</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">slug</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Error</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`Invalid CSS class name: <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${slug}</span>`</span>)\n  },\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الأمان\">الأمان</h2>\n<p>أدوات CSS المساعدة هي واجهات برمجة لتأليف CSS: مثل مكتبات CSS-in-JS الأخرى، تُدرج القيم المُقحمة (interpolated) كـ <strong>CSS خام</strong>. تمنع الاختراق إلى HTML (علامات الاقتباس والخطوط المائلة العكسية و <code>&lt;/</code>)، لكن <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>، و <code>;</code> تمر مباشرةً لأنها CSS صالحة.</p>\n<p>تعامل مع مساعدات CSS مثل بقية المصارف الخام (<code>html</code>, <code>raw</code>, <code>rawCssString</code>): <strong>لا تمرر مدخلات غير موثوقة إليها مباشرة.</strong> القيام بذلك يسمح بحقن CSS. تحقق من صحة المدخلات مقابل قائمة مسموح بها (allowlist) أولًا.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">ALLOWED_COLORS</span> = [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;red&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;green&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;blue&#x27;</span>]\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> color = <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">ALLOWED_COLORS</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">includes</span>(input) ? input : <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;black&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> headerClass = css`<span class=\"language-css\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: </span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${color}</span><span class=\"language-css\">;\n`</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"نصائح\">نصائح</h2>\n<p>إذا كنت تستخدم VS Code، فيمكنك استخدام <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=styled-components.vscode-styled-components\">vscode-styled-components</a> لتلوين الصيغة (Syntax highlighting) و IntelliSense للعبارات النصية الموسومة بـ CSS (tagged literals).</p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/css-ss.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n"}